# Data — never commit. Harmful prompts (raw/, processed/) and raw model completions
# (results/labels/*.csv carry prompt+response columns) live here; everything is fetched
# (datasets, via scripts/01_download_data.py) or regenerated (results) at setup. Only the
# pointer doc is tracked.
data/*
!data/README.md

# Demo data — same never-commit rule as data/. The published demo file is
# LABELS ONLY (judge labels + SSI stats; raw completions redacted 2026-07-01 and
# purged from history). Only that one labels-only file is tracked; any other file
# under demo/data/ (esp. a regenerated raw prompts.json) must never be committed.
demo/data/*
!demo/data/prompts.json

# Pilot artifact bundle (bloat; regenerable)
artifact2_pilot_results.tar.gz
